   \"\"\"Add a quantity-color label in the top marker column for each horizontal bar.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/e048c9ed.py:26:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/e048c9ed.py:102:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/34cfa167.py:93:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/34cfa167.py:94:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/34cfa167.py:97:    Input structure:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/34cfa167.py:104:    Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/34cfa167.py:114:    Key insight: The small control bars are the first two ticks of two periodic\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/34cfa167.py:117:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/34cfa167.py:336:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/7e576d6e.py:158:def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/7e576d6e.py:159:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/7e576d6e.py:162:    Input structure:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/7e576d6e.py:168:    Rule:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/7e576d6e.py:177:    Key insight:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/7e576d6e.py:181:    \"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/7e576d6e.py:217:    \"\"\"Place n positions in [lo..hi] with pairwise gap >= min_gap between consecutive sorted positions.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/7e576d6e.py:228:    \"\"\"Return wall positions and per-wall door centers for the chosen orientation.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/7e576d6e.py:244:    \"\"\"Sample start/end markers on opposite outer corridors.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/7e576d6e.py:262:    \"\"\"Render walls, doors, and the two markers into a fresh input grid.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/7e576d6e.py:299:def generate_input() -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ARC_code/train/833966f4.py:7:de